    { "type": "text", "id": "callout_t", "x": 78, "y": 782, "width": 326, "height": 230,
      "text": "THE ISSUE (for support ticket)\n\nInbound works: Teams \u2192 Bot Service\n\u2192 APIM \u2192 Foundry activityprotocol\nreturns 202. Agent runs & replies.\n\nBut the Databricks Genie MCP tool\nuses OAuth Identity Passthrough.\nmcp_list_tools returns an\noauth_consent_request, not tools.\n\nThe consent link never renders in\nthe Teams UI, and consenting in the\nplayground does NOT persist to the\nTeams session \u2192 0 tools in Teams.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top" }
  ]
